{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51881","headline":"奉和咏雪应制（和太宗） · 无名氏","name":"奉和咏雪应制（和太宗）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒云垂广幕，飘霰下天津。\n无辙方秪至，有感瑞气新。\n色映姑山质，舞对洛川神。\n忽奉瑶池韵，渐和郢中春。\n（《文苑英华》一七三《应制》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51881.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51881","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}